            "review_title": "Review at Ben Nay Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lexibelle\nPhoenix, Arizona1715 contributions\n1\nLovely open air restaurant\nNov 2023 • Friends\n80 of us stopped here for lunch in our way to meet up with the Viking river cruise. We were seated at lovely covered patios by the river. The food was delivered as family style servings and included seafood, pork, chicken and sides as well as dessert at the end. Service was good and the food was good too. The facilities are also nice. It was a fun stop on way to our adventure. We never saw a menu so it must have been pre-arranged. They were also able to help with some food intolerances. Lovely surroundings, we would recommend.\nRead more\nWritten January 21, 2024",
